<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Propuesta Comercial - Agencia de Turismo (3 Flyers)</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
            background-color: #e5e7eb;
        }
        /* Ocultar barra de scroll en el mockup */
        .no-scrollbar::-webkit-scrollbar {
            display: none;
        }
        .no-scrollbar {
            -ms-overflow-style: none;
            scrollbar-width: none;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="py-12 px-4 md:px-8 flex flex-col items-center gap-12">

    <!-- Instrucción para el usuario -->
    <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mb-4">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-800">Tu Presentación Comercial</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-600">Exporta cada uno de estos bloques como una imagen o PDF independiente para enviarlos como un carrusel o documento multipágina a tu cliente.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- ==========================================
         FLYER 1: EL GANCHO Y EL PROBLEMA
    =========================================== -->
    <div class="w-full max-w-5xl bg-white rounded-3xl shadow-2xl overflow-hidden relative flex flex-col justify-center min-h-[600px] lg:aspect-[16/9]">
        <!-- Fondo General Web -->
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1498050108023-c5249f4df085?auto=format&fit=crop&w=2000&q=80" alt="Diseño Web" class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover">
        
        <!-- Degradado para legibilidad -->
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#003840]/95 via-[#006573]/80 to-transparent"></div>
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/60 to-transparent lg:hidden"></div>

        <!-- Contenido -->
        <div class="relative z-10 p-10 lg:p-20 w-full lg:w-3/4">
            <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-[#50e1f9]/20 backdrop-blur-sm border border-[#50e1f9]/30 px-5 py-2.5 rounded-full mb-8">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-[#50e1f9]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"></path></svg>
                <span class="text-[#50e1f9] text-sm font-bold tracking-wider uppercase">Nodus Agency</span>
            </div>
            
            <h1 class="text-5xl lg:text-7xl font-black text-white leading-[1.1] mb-6 drop-shadow-lg">
                ¿Tu negocio aún no tiene <span class="text-[#50e1f9]">presencia online?</span>
            </h1>
            
            <p class="text-xl lg:text-2xl text-white/90 font-medium mb-10 border-l-4 border-[#50e1f9] pl-6 py-2">
                "Diseñamos páginas web premium que venden por ti."
            </p>

            <p class="text-lg text-white/80 max-w-lg">
                Atrae más clientes, muestra tus servicios de forma profesional y genera confianza desde el primer clic.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- ==========================================
         FLYER 2: LA SOLUCIÓN (Cero Solapamiento)
    =========================================== -->
    <div class="w-full max-w-5xl bg-[#f4f7f7] rounded-3xl shadow-2xl overflow-hidden relative flex flex-col lg:flex-row min-h-[600px] lg:aspect-[16/9]">
        
        <!-- Mitad Izquierda: Beneficios -->
        <div class="w-full lg:w-1/2 p-10 lg:p-16 flex flex-col justify-center relative z-10">
            <h2 class="text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-black text-[#003840] leading-tight mb-4">
                Tu negocio, <br><span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-[#006573] to-[#50e1f9]">abierto 24/7</span>
            </h2>
            <p class="text-gray-600 text-lg mb-10">Una Landing Page diseñada específicamente para vender tus productos o servicios.</p>

            <ul class="space-y-8">
                <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
                    <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-[#006573]/10 flex items-center justify-center text-[#006573] flex-shrink-0">
                        <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M4 16l4.586-4.586a2 2 0 012.828 0L16 16m-2-2l1.586-1.586a2 2 0 012.828 0L20 14m-6-6h.01M6 20h12a2 2 0 002-2V6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2z"></path></svg>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <h4 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#004d58]">Impacto Visual</h4>
                        <p class="text-[#585c5c] font-medium mt-1">Muestra tus 3 productos o servicios estrella con un diseño premium que enamora a primera vista.</p>
                    </div>
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
                    <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-green-100 flex items-center justify-center text-green-600 flex-shrink-0">
                        <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M17.472 14.382c-.297-.149-1.758-.867-2.03-.967-.273-.099-.471-.148-.67.15-.197.297-.767.966-.94 1.164-.173.199-.347.223-.644.075-.297-.15-1.255-.463-2.39-1.475-.883-.788-1.48-1.761-1.653-2.059-.173-.297-.018-.458.13-.606.134-.133.298-.347.446-.52.149-.174.198-.298.298-.497.099-.198.05-.371-.025-.52-.075-.149-.669-1.612-.916-2.207-.242-.579-.487-.5-.669-.51a12.8 12.8 0 00-.57-.01c-.198 0-.52.074-.792.372-.272.297-1.04 1.016-1.04 2.479 0 1.462 1.065 2.875 1.213 3.074.149.198 2.096 3.2 5.077 4.487.709.306 1.262.489 1.694.625.712.227 1.36.195 1.871.118.571-.085 1.758-.719 2.006-1.413.248-.694.248-1.289.173-1.413-.074-.124-.272-.198-.57-.347m-5.421 7.403h-.004a9.87 9.87 0 01-5.031-1.378l-.361-.214-3.741.982.998-3.648-.235-.374a9.86 9.86 0 01-1.51-5.26c.001-5.45 4.436-9.884 9.888-9.884 2.64 0 5.122 1.03 6.988 2.898a9.825 9.825 0 012.893 6.994c-.003 5.45-4.437 9.884-9.885 9.884m8.413-18.297A11.815 11.815 0 0012.05 0C5.495 0 .16 5.335.157 11.892c0 2.096.547 4.142 1.588 5.945L.057 24l6.305-1.654a11.882 11.882 0 005.683 1.448h.005c6.554 0 11.89-5.335 11.893-11.893a11.821 11.821 0 00-3.48-8.413Z"/></svg>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <h4 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#004d58]">Reservas Directas</h4>
                        <p class="text-[#585c5c] font-medium mt-1">Botones directos a tu WhatsApp para cerrar ventas sin intermediarios.</p>
                    </div>
                </li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Mitad Derecha: Mockup Celular (Optimizada, cero solapamiento) -->
        <div class="w-full lg:w-1/2 relative bg-gradient-to-br from-[#006573] to-[#003840] flex items-center justify-center p-10 overflow-hidden">
            <!-- Círculos decorativos de fondo -->
            <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-64 h-64 bg-[#50e1f9]/20 rounded-full blur-3xl transform translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2"></div>
            <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-64 h-64 bg-[#006573] rounded-full blur-3xl transform -translate-x-1/2 translate-y-1/2"></div>
            
            <!-- Marco del Celular (Contenido Minimalista) -->
            <div class="w-[280px] h-[560px] bg-gray-900 rounded-[3rem] border-[12px] border-gray-900 relative shadow-2xl flex flex-col z-10 transform lg:rotate-3 hover:rotate-0 transition-transform duration-500">
                <!-- Isla Dinámica -->
                <div class="absolute top-0 inset-x-0 h-7 bg-gray-900 rounded-b-3xl w-32 mx-auto z-40 flex items-center justify-center gap-2">
                    <div class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-gray-800"></div>
                </div>

                <!-- Pantalla -->
                <div class="w-full h-full bg-[#f4f7f7] relative overflow-hidden rounded-[2rem] flex flex-col">
                    <!-- Hero Mockup con foto general -->
                    <div class="h-[250px] relative shrink-0">
                        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1556761175-5973dc0f32e7?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80" class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover">
                        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/80 to-transparent"></div>
                        <div class="absolute bottom-4 left-4 right-4 z-10">
                            <div class="text-[8px] font-bold text-[#50e1f9] uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">Tu Marca Aquí</div>
                            <h2 class="text-white text-xl font-black leading-tight mb-2">Impulsa Tu<br><span class="text-[#50e1f9]">Negocio</span></h2>
                            <div class="bg-[#006573] text-white text-[10px] py-1.5 px-3 rounded-full inline-block">Ver Catálogo</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <!-- Servicios Mockup -->
                    <div class="p-4 flex-1">
                        <h3 class="text-sm font-black text-[#2b2f30] mb-3">Servicios Estrella</h3>
                        <div class="w-full h-[120px] rounded-xl overflow-hidden relative shadow-md">
                            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1505373877841-8d25f7d46678?auto=format&fit=crop&w=400&q=80" class="w-full h-full object-cover">
                            <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/70 to-transparent"></div>
                            <div class="absolute bottom-2 left-2 text-white font-bold text-xs">Servicio Premium</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <!-- Botón Flotante -->
                    <div class="absolute bottom-4 right-4 w-10 h-10 bg-green-500 rounded-full shadow-lg border-2 border-white flex justify-center items-center">
                        <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-white" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M17.472 14.382c-.297-.149-1.758-.867-2.03-.967-.273-.099-.471-.148-.67.15-.197.297-.767.966-.94 1.164-.173.199-.347.223-.644.075-.297-.15-1.255-.463-2.39-1.475-.883-.788-1.48-1.761-1.653-2.059-.173-.297-.018-.458.13-.606.134-.133.298-.347.446-.52.149-.174.198-.298.298-.497.099-.198.05-.371-.025-.52-.075-.149-.669-1.612-.916-2.207-.242-.579-.487-.5-.669-.51a12.8 12.8 0 00-.57-.01c-.198 0-.52.074-.792.372-.272.297-1.04 1.016-1.04 2.479 0 1.462 1.065 2.875 1.213 3.074.149.198 2.096 3.2 5.077 4.487.709.306 1.262.489 1.694.625.712.227 1.36.195 1.871.118.571-.085 1.758-.719 2.006-1.413.248-.694.248-1.289.173-1.413-.074-.124-.272-.198-.57-.347m-5.421 7.403h-.004a9.87 9.87 0 01-5.031-1.378l-.361-.214-3.741.982.998-3.648-.235-.374a9.86 9.86 0 01-1.51-5.26c.001-5.45 4.436-9.884 9.888-9.884 2.64 0 5.122 1.03 6.988 2.898a9.825 9.825 0 012.893 6.994c-.003 5.45-4.437 9.884-9.885 9.884m8.413-18.297A11.815 11.815 0 0012.05 0C5.495 0 .16 5.335.157 11.892c0 2.096.547 4.142 1.588 5.945L.057 24l6.305-1.654a11.882 11.882 0 005.683 1.448h.005c6.554 0 11.89-5.335 11.893-11.893a11.821 11.821 0 00-3.48-8.413Z"/></svg>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- ==========================================
         FLYER 3: LA OFERTA Y CTA
    =========================================== -->
    <div class="w-full max-w-5xl bg-white rounded-3xl shadow-2xl overflow-hidden relative flex flex-col justify-center items-center text-center p-10 lg:p-20 min-h-[600px] lg:aspect-[16/9]">
        <!-- Fondo suave con imagen tech/business desenfocada -->
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1498050108023-c5249f4df085?auto=format&fit=crop&w=2000&q=80" alt="Textura fondo general" class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover opacity-5">
        
        <div class="relative z-10 w-full max-w-3xl flex flex-col items-center">
            
            <div class="inline-block bg-[#ff6b6b] text-white font-extrabold px-6 py-2 rounded-xl text-lg mb-8 shadow-lg transform -rotate-2">
                OFERTA DE LANZAMIENTO
            </div>

            <h2 class="text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-black text-[#003840] mb-6">
                Tu presencia digital,<br>lista en <span class="text-[#006573]">48 horas.</span>
            </h2>

            <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 mb-12">
                Obtén un diseño profesional, optimizado para celulares y conectado directamente a tu WhatsApp.
            </p>

            <div class="bg-[#f4f7f7] border-2 border-[#006573]/20 w-full rounded-2xl p-8 mb-10 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-6 shadow-sm">
                <div class="text-left">
                    <p class="text-gray-500 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-sm mb-2">INVERSIÓN ÚNICA</p>
                    <div class="flex items-end gap-2 justify-center md:justify-start">
                        <span class="text-6xl font-black text-[#006573]">$60</span>
                        <span class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-400 mb-2">USD</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <ul class="text-left text-gray-700 font-medium space-y-2">
                    <li class="flex items-center gap-2">✓ Diseño Premium</li>
                    <li class="flex items-center gap-2">✓ 3 Productos Estrellas</li>
                    <li class="flex items-center gap-2">✓ Integración con WhatsApp</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <button class="w-full md:w-auto bg-gradient-to-r from-[#006573] to-[#004d58] hover:from-[#004d58] hover:to-[#003840] text-white text-xl font-bold py-5 px-12 rounded-full shadow-xl hover:shadow-[#006573]/40 transform hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all flex items-center justify-center gap-3">
                <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M17.472 14.382c-.297-.149-1.758-.867-2.03-.967-.273-.099-.471-.148-.67.15-.197.297-.767.966-.94 1.164-.173.199-.347.223-.644.075-.297-.15-1.255-.463-2.39-1.475-.883-.788-1.48-1.761-1.653-2.059-.173-.297-.018-.458.13-.606.134-.133.298-.347.446-.52.149-.174.198-.298.298-.497.099-.198.05-.371-.025-.52-.075-.149-.669-1.612-.916-2.207-.242-.579-.487-.5-.669-.51a12.8 12.8 0 00-.57-.01c-.198 0-.52.074-.792.372-.272.297-1.04 1.016-1.04 2.479 0 1.462 1.065 2.875 1.213 3.074.149.198 2.096 3.2 5.077 4.487.709.306 1.262.489 1.694.625.712.227 1.36.195 1.871.118.571-.085 1.758-.719 2.006-1.413.248-.694.248-1.289.173-1.413-.074-.124-.272-.198-.57-.347m-5.421 7.403h-.004a9.87 9.87 0 01-5.031-1.378l-.361-.214-3.741.982.998-3.648-.235-.374a9.86 9.86 0 01-1.51-5.26c.001-5.45 4.436-9.884 9.888-9.884 2.64 0 5.122 1.03 6.988 2.898a9.825 9.825 0 012.893 6.994c-.003 5.45-4.437 9.884-9.885 9.884m8.413-18.297A11.815 11.815 0 0012.05 0C5.495 0 .16 5.335.157 11.892c0 2.096.547 4.142 1.588 5.945L.057 24l6.305-1.654a11.882 11.882 0 005.683 1.448h.005c6.554 0 11.89-5.335 11.893-11.893a11.821 11.821 0 00-3.48-8.413Z"/></svg>
                Quiero mi Landing Page
            </button>
        </div>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
